⏱️ STEP 6: EXECUTE A BOUNDED UPSTREAM CALL
   ├── ⏳ Enforce request deadlines and timeouts
   ├── 🔁 Apply carefully scoped retries
   └── 🧯 Use a circuit breaker where appropriate

       ↓

📤 STEP 7: RETURN RESPONSE AND OBSERVE
   ├── 🔄 Response mapping
   ├── 🔗 Trace context propagation
   ├── 📊 Metrics and logging
