-------------------------------------------------------
🎯 END RESULT
The client receives a controlled response, while the
gateway enforces security, traffic policies, routing,
resilience and observability across the request lifecycle.
-------------------------------------------------------

This is a logical sequence, not a requirement that all processing be implemented
as seven separate network hops. Many stages are local filters 
inside the same gateway process.



